# The resolver-matrix fixture COMMITS its node_modules trees on purpose:
# module-resolution parity requires a real node_modules layout (bare
# packages, scoped packages, exports/main/types fields, index resolution,
# self-referencing package, imports field). These local rules negate the
# root .gitignore's blanket `node_modules/` and `dist` exclusions for this
# fixture subtree only (the scoped package's exports point at ./dist/*).
!node_modules/
!dist/
!**/dist/
